        <rule id="4388-e0d8-0c86-267b" name="Specialised Operations" hidden="false">
          <description>After deciding which scenario to play, but before Recon rolls, choose one of the following army wide special rules.  If more players have this option, choose in secret and reveal it simultaneously. </description>
